we'll join you.</i>

971
01:20:34,830 --> 01:20:37,249
<i>You must protect the planet.</i>

972
01:20:37,332 --> 01:20:42,462
<i>If the Decepticons find it,
then our people are truly finished.</i>

973
01:20:42,546 --> 01:20:44,548
