1000
01:21:54,576 --> 01:21:57,913
Charlie's fallen ill and must stay in
her bedroom for the rest of the evening.

1001
01:21:57,996 --> 01:22:01,291
She wishes not to be troubled.
Keep clear of her chambers.

1002
01:22:01,541 --> 01:22:02,584
What?

1003
01:22:06,922 --> 01:22:08,340
Charlie has fallen ill

1004
01:22:08,423 --> 01:22:11,218
and must stay in her bedroom
for the rest of the evening.

1005
01:22:11,301 --> 01:22:13,637
- She wishes not to...
- Otis!

1006
01:22:13,720 --> 01:22:15,180
Are you on drugs?

1007
01:22:15,931 --> 01:22:17,390
No, no. Mom, Mom, Mom.

1008
01:22:17,474 --> 01:22:19,142
- Please stop. Stop!
- Charlie!

1009
01:22:19,226 --> 01:22:21,269
- Mom, there is no reason to go...
- Where is she?

1010
01:22:21,353 --> 01:22:23,230
- Mom, stop!
- Quit it, Otis.

1011
01:22:29,236 --> 01:22:30,487
Where is she?

1012
01:22:34,116 --> 01:22:35,492
Otis?

1013
01:22:38,120 --> 01:22:40,330
I found a tower to transmit our message.

1014
01:22:40,705 --> 01:22:41,832
It's close.

1015
01:22:43,291 --> 01:22:47,295
B-127. I almost forgot.

1016
01:22:47,379 --> 01:22:48,672
I didn't.

1017
01:22:51,007 --> 01:22:52,425
No! Don't shoot!

1018
01:22:54,427 --> 01:22:55,470
No!

1019
01:23:11,236 --> 01:23:12,404
Bee!

1020
01:23:14,948 --> 01:23:16,366
Talk to me, Bee, talk to me.

1021
01:23:22,873 --> 01:23:25,625
I can fix this. I can fix this.

1022
01:23:29,838 --> 01:23:30,922
Charlie.

1023
